WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.244 --> 00:00:07.486
"Be careful!"

2
00:00:14.489 --> 00:00:15.410
Roxy's mom said.

3
00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:16.830
Terrell and Dr.

4
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:18.111
Odd were in robot suits.

5
00:00:18.871 --> 00:00:20.132
Bippo floated between them.

6
00:00:20.152 --> 00:00:24.553
"Bippo has a built-in portal projector," Dr.

7
00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:25.094
Odd said.

8
00:00:25.114 --> 00:00:28.055
"He can send us to Wukong's world."

9
00:00:30.944 --> 00:00:31.244
"Helpful, me!"

10
00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:34.047
"Then we'll find Wukong's friends," Terrell said.

11
00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.308
"They can bring us to Guanyin."

12
00:00:37.129 --> 00:00:38.370
Dr. Odd's phone beeped.

13
00:00:39.611 --> 00:00:41.493
"Hello? Mayor Bloom!"

14
00:00:41.513 --> 00:00:45.756
"An earthquake knocked over a building," the mayor said.

15
00:00:45.776 --> 00:00:47.838
"I can't reach Rocket Girl.

16
00:00:48.338 --> 00:00:49.919
We need your big robot."

17
00:00:49.939 --> 00:00:51.681
"Oh dear!"

18
00:00:52.161 --> 00:00:53.082
Dr. Odd said.

19
00:00:53.102 --> 00:00:55.644
"I I'm on my way!"

20
00:00:55.664 --> 00:00:59.027
"I'll go with you," Roxy's mom said.

21
00:00:59.047 --> 00:01:00.288
"I'm a doctor."

22
00:01:01.132 --> 00:01:03.073
"Wait! What about our mission?"

23
00:01:03.513 --> 00:01:04.233
Terrell said.

24
00:01:04.253 --> 00:01:08.435
"If we don't go, the earthquakes will cause even more damage."

25
00:01:09.095 --> 00:01:10.036
Dr. Odd nodded.

26
00:01:10.056 --> 00:01:11.136
"You're right.

27
00:01:11.556 --> 00:01:13.617
But people are in danger right now.

28
00:01:14.778 --> 00:01:16.178
Can you go by yourself?"

29
00:01:17.419 --> 00:01:18.179
Terrell gulped.

30
00:01:19.359 --> 00:01:22.321
"I never did a solo mission before," he thought.

31
00:01:22.341 --> 00:01:25.142
"I don't have super powers like Roxy."

32
00:01:25.982 --> 00:01:28.183
He remembered his conversation with the Tang Monk.

33
00:01:28.683 --> 00:01:32.173
The monk didn't have super powers, but he was helping lots of people.

34
00:01:32.193 --> 00:01:34.474
"Yes," Terrell said.

35
00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.054
"I can do it!"

36
00:01:36.575 --> 00:01:37.615
Bippo flew around him.

37
00:01:37.635 --> 00:01:39.776
"Partners, us!"

38
00:01:40.696 --> 00:01:41.437
Terrell laughed.

39
00:01:41.797 --> 00:01:43.838
"Okay, Bippo.

40
00:01:44.258 --> 00:01:45.398
I'm ready when you are!"

41
00:01:47.139 --> 00:01:48.300
Bippo opened the portal.

42
00:01:50.741 --> 00:01:51.521
"Good luck!"

43
00:01:51.961 --> 00:01:53.682
Roxy's mom said as they stepped through.

44
00:01:53.702 --> 00:01:58.104
"Hmph!" the crocodile demon said.

45
00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.753
"I really wanted to live forever!"

46
00:02:01.773 --> 00:02:04.414
He and the plant demon sat in some dirty swamp water.

47
00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:07.654
"Yeah," the plant demon said.

48
00:02:07.674 --> 00:02:09.795
"That would've been great."

49
00:02:10.775 --> 00:02:11.856
A little demon came along.

50
00:02:11.876 --> 00:02:13.476
"What's wrong?"

51
00:02:14.076 --> 00:02:15.137
The plant demon sighed.

52
00:02:15.157 --> 00:02:19.578
"We were going to eat the Tang Monk and live forever."

53
00:02:20.498 --> 00:02:21.918
The little demon's eyes lit up.

54
00:02:22.559 --> 00:02:25.639
"Wonderful!" The crocodile demon snorted.

55
00:02:25.659 --> 00:02:27.520
"It's not wonderful.

56
00:02:28.144 --> 00:02:30.525
Sun Wukong chased us away."

57
00:02:31.085 --> 00:02:31.846
He made a fist.

58
00:02:32.806 --> 00:02:35.087
"I can't stand that monkey!"

59
00:02:35.967 --> 00:02:37.728
The little demon laughed.

60
00:02:38.648 --> 00:02:40.729
"Didn't you hear the good news?"

61
00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.270
The crocodile demon raised an eyebrow.

62
00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:45.011
"What good news?"

63
00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:49.033
"Sun Wukong is gone," the little demon said.

64
00:02:49.053 --> 00:02:51.694
"A mysterious figure took him away."

65
00:02:52.314 --> 00:02:53.474
The plant demon stood up.

66
00:02:54.255 --> 00:02:57.116
"Really?" The little demon nodded.

67
00:02:57.704 --> 00:02:59.344
"I know where the Tang Monk is."

68
00:02:59.905 --> 00:03:00.505
He frowned.

69
00:03:00.525 --> 00:03:02.225
"But I'm small.

70
00:03:02.805 --> 00:03:04.706
I can't fight his two friends."

71
00:03:04.726 --> 00:03:07.107
"Well, we're big."

72
00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:09.187
The crocodile demon stood up.

73
00:03:09.207 --> 00:03:12.028
"Show us where he is, little buddy.

74
00:03:12.568 --> 00:03:14.789
Then we'll all live forever!"

75
00:03:15.709 --> 00:03:17.249
The little demon jumped up and down.

76
00:03:17.269 --> 00:03:22.211
"Woo-hoo!" The three demons headed down a road.

77
00:03:23.411 --> 00:03:24.791
Soon they saw another demon.

78
00:03:25.852 --> 00:03:26.992
They hid behind a boulder.

79
00:03:30.284 --> 00:03:31.465
The little demon frowned.

80
00:03:31.485 --> 00:03:34.106
"That demon is big."

81
00:03:34.766 --> 00:03:36.567
"Yep," the crocodile demon said.

82
00:03:36.587 --> 00:03:39.888
"I'll bet he wants to eat the Tang Monk too."

83
00:03:40.808 --> 00:03:43.289
"I hope not," the plant demon said.

84
00:03:43.309 --> 00:03:45.790
"There won't be anything left for us!"

85
00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:48.832
"Lost, us!"

86
00:03:48.852 --> 00:03:51.673
"You're right, Bippo," Terrell said.

87
00:03:52.513 --> 00:03:54.534
They couldn't find Wukong's friends anywhere.

88
00:03:56.275 --> 00:03:57.755
The road took them through a swamp.

89
00:03:58.616 --> 00:04:01.790
They saw a hut, where three old men were working in a garden.

90
00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:03.951
When the men saw Terrell, they trembled.

91
00:04:03.971 --> 00:04:05.832
"Don't hurt us!"

92
00:04:06.373 --> 00:04:06.933
one cried.

93
00:04:07.694 --> 00:04:08.834
Terrell felt awful.

94
00:04:08.854 --> 00:04:11.736
"They think I'm a monster," he thought.

95
00:04:12.637 --> 00:04:14.378
He opened the robot's head and waved.

96
00:04:14.979 --> 00:04:16.060
The men came closer.

97
00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.041
"Hi," Terrell said.

98
00:04:18.061 --> 00:04:20.282
"I'm looking for the Tang Monk."

99
00:04:21.183 --> 00:04:22.624
The three men looked at one another.

100
00:04:23.585 --> 00:04:24.646
Then they looked at Terrell.

101
00:04:24.666 --> 00:04:26.427
"Didn't you hear?"

102
00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:27.848
one of the men said.

103
00:04:28.793 --> 00:04:30.518
"Sun Wukong is gone.

104
00:04:30.979 --> 00:04:33.626
The Tang Monk was captured by demons!"
